AlohaMini migrated components

integrations/lerobot/src/alohamini_lerobot/policies and train.py adapt
src/lerobot/policies and scripts/lerobot_train.py from
https://github.com/annncatto/lerobot_alohamini at
df96a6889901b3e1a627b59f9e0bf11c03fc9026 (Apache-2.0).
Original copyright headers are retained in the copied files; sources.json
records source paths and checksums. Changes: integration-local imports,
LeRobot 0.6.1 type-module imports, separate policy/processor registration names,
lazy package exports and PI0-FAST processor dispatch. The installed LeRobot
provides the shared policy base, data, processing, optimizers and training
utilities. Native ACT/AM-ACT and the official ACT adapter remain separate.
No pretrained weights or model-specific weight licenses are bundled.

The temporal index query in src/alohamini/learning/data.py adapts
DatasetReader._get_query_indices from src/lerobot/datasets/dataset_reader.py
(Apache-2.0, Copyright 2024 The HuggingFace Inc. team).
Per-field row offsets and boundary padding are retained; recorded control
interruptions add boundaries within episodes. Field-dependent sample filtering
preserves physical rows and offsets. Camera timing warnings do not split windows.

src/alohamini/learning/train.py and training_state.py adapt the local
ACT/AM-ACT training path from src/lerobot/scripts/lerobot_train.py,
datasets/sampler.py, common/train_utils.py and utils/random_utils.py
(Apache-2.0, Copyright 2024 The HuggingFace Inc. team).
The epoch sampler and resume-offset calculation are retained. Changes:
native dataset/policy factories, local long-option parsing, single-device FP32
updates, atomic native checkpoints and weights-only optimizer/RNG loading.
Remote jobs, Hub uploads, W&B, simulation evaluation and distributed training
are not part of this local entry point.

src/alohamini/model/types.py, models/*/model.json, src/alohamini/kinematics.py and
src/alohamini/runtime/command_owner.py contain adaptations of Apache-2.0 code.
The accompanying LICENSE retains the source repository's license text.

